  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact 23-0001665  Increasing the participation and empowerment of young voters toward a stronger democracy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact 23-0001665 This activity seeks to increase the participation of young voters ahead of Indonesia&apos;s 2024 election, by empowering them through workshop and capacity building activities in 5 provinces in Indonesia. The project will also produce tools (such as infographic or public seminar) to further widen the scope of the campaign.</narrative>
  </description>
